### Login (setzt {{token}} für die folgenden Requests)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> extract-token.js

### Profil abrufen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

### Profil abrufen ohne Cookie (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me

### Profil aktualisieren (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

{
  "firstName": "Max",
  "lastName": "Muster"
}

### E-Mail ändern (200 + neues Auth-Cookie)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/email
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

{
  "newEmail": "{{newEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> extract-token.js

### E-Mail zurücksetzen (200 + neues Auth-Cookie)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/email
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

{
  "newEmail": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> extract-token.js

### Passwort ändern (204 + neues Auth-Cookie)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "{{password}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

> extract-token.js

### Passwort zurücksetzen (204 + neues Auth-Cookie)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "{{newPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{password}}"
}

> extract-token.js

### Konto löschen (204 + Logout-Cookie) – danach muss neu registriert werden
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: access_token={{token}}

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}
